# Pox Plague in a game of three. Every player loses half their life first; then Bot1 is asked which cards to discard, and
# Bot2 concedes then. Bot2 had already lost half its life when it left (CR 104.3a: a concession comes when it is made), so
# it left at 10 life; Bot3 discards half its hand and Bot1 sacrifices half its permanents.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Swamp
Black Lotus
Pox Plague
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Bot3 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
[T4 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Pox Plague.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot3.Pass
Bot2.Concede
Bot1.Choose(Island; Island)
Bot3.Choose(Island; Island; Island)
Bot1.Choose(Swamp)

[Expect]
Bot2.Status = Lost
Bot1.Life = 10
Bot2.Life = 10
Bot3.Life = 10
Bot3.Hand.Count = 4
Bot1.Battlefield = Swamp
